A bar for what to do with several things chosen at once: how many, a way out and the
actions, which are disabled while nothing is chosen. Escape also leaves. It goes where the
field to write in was, or over a list; the app decides when it shows.

```
use ravenrs_widgets::{IconName, SelectionBar, ToolbarAction, Ui};

let bar = SelectionBar::new(3)
    .on_exit(|| {})
    .action(ToolbarAction::new("Copy").icon(IconName::Copy).icon_only().on_click(|| {}));
let mut ui = Ui::new(bar, ravenrs_style::Theme::raven_dark());
ui.update();
```

7039.docs:
A repeating schedule, starting from a date given when asking for its days.
A date past the end of a shorter month falls on that month's last day and
returns to its own day after: the 31st is February 28, then March 31.

```
use ravenrs_widgets::{Date, Frequency, RecurrenceEnd, RecurrenceRule};

let start = Date::new(2026, 1, 31).unwrap();
let rule = RecurrenceRule::new(Frequency::Monthly).end(RecurrenceEnd::After(3));
let days = rule.occurrences(start, start, start.add_months(12));
assert_eq!(days, [start, Date::new(2026, 2, 28).unwrap(), Date::new(2026, 3, 31).unwrap()]);

// It can be stored as text, in the format of iCalendar.
assert_eq!(rule.to_text(), "FREQ=MONTHLY;COUNT=3");
assert_eq!(RecurrenceRule::parse(&rule.to_text()), Some(rule));
```

7188.docs:
Any number of panes side by side or stacked, with a bar to drag between each two.
Panes can have limits, and the sizes can be kept by the app to remember them.

```
use ravenrs_widgets::{SplitPane, SplitPanes, Text, Ui};

let columns = SplitPanes::horizontal()
    .pane(SplitPane::new(Text::new("Sessions")).size(280.0).range(200.0, 400.0))
    .pane(SplitPane::new(Text::new("Receipt")).range(320.0, f32::MAX))
    .pane(SplitPane::new(Text::new("Activity")).size(300.0).range(240.0, 420.0))
    .height(400.0);
let mut ui = Ui::new(columns, ravenrs_style::Theme::raven_dark());
ui.update();
```

8642.docs:
A handle to show toasts from anywhere (event handlers, async tasks).
Place one [`Toaster`] in the UI to display them.

```
use ravenrs_widgets::{Toaster, Toasts, Tone, Ui};

let toasts = Toasts::new();
let mut ui = Ui::new(Toaster::new(toasts.clone()), ravenrs_style::Theme::raven_dark());

toasts.show("Saved", "Your changes are stored.", Tone::Success);
assert_eq!(toasts.len(), 1);
ui.update();
```
